<title>CHINA: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP ASIA/OCEANIA GROUP ONE, FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP ASIA/OCEANIA GROUP ONE, FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>China and Uzbekistan are level 1-1 after the opening singles matches in their Davis Cup Asia/Oceania zone group one, first round tie on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Xia Jiaping (China) beat Dmitry Tomashevich (Uzbekistan) 6-4 7-6 (7-3) 6-3</p>
<p>Oleg Ogorodov (Uzbekistan) beat Pan Bing (China) 6-2 6-4 7-5</p>
</text>
